      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a proposal for a new multi-family residential complex in a mid-sized city. To prep for the community board meeting, I need a quick rundown of the common criticisms people usually have against high-density zoning laws in these kinds of metro areas. Can you give me a list of what those arguments usually are?",
